+//
+// MP31 pipeline barrier budget helper
+//
+// Picks the largest power-of-two BarPerStageRatio in (0, MaxBarPerStageRatio_] such that every
+// listed pipeline fits into the async transaction barrier file after AdditionalBarrier_ barriers
+// are reserved for other uses:
+//
+//   2 * (PipelineStages_ + ...) * ratio <= MaxAsyncBarriers - AdditionalBarrier_
+//
